          },
          "warnings": [],
          "fit": 0.85
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "text": "A unit's reckless operational crossing triggered a grid incident, forcing the grid's reactive controller to lock down the Visayas under a red alert. The officials who caged demand imposed emergency restrictions to prevent a massive deficit caging the grid. This forced the power generators into uncharted territory as they navigated the energy demand spike, exposing the system's festering vulnerabilities in a critical time of shortage.",
